OL,3,APM believes Brexit vote was legitimate
OL,4,Adespite Russia claims, No 10 says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham told The Rest is Politics
OL,7,Fpodcast, that upon arriving in Downing
OL,8,FStreet, he had asked if there had been
OL,9,FRussian interference in the vote,
OL,10,Fadding: "I've had the clear answer
OL,11,Fthat, yes, there was."
OL,13,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage called
OL,14,Fthe prime minister a "liar" while the
OL,15,FConservatives said he had been "at
OL,16,Fbest... carelessly vague".
